<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR STARTS DOWN AT $85-5/8 IN NEW YORK.</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR STARTS DOWN AT $85-5/8 IN NEW YORK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia Oy's A share ADR opened down $1-1/8 at $85-5/8 in New York on Monday after the telecoms group reported slightly higher than expected first-half profits.</p>
<p>The price corresponded to about 476 markka.</p>
<p>Nokia's January-June profit before before tax and minorities was 3.33 billion markka compared to a median forecast of 3.09 billion markka (range 2,966-3,300 million) in a Reuters poll.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
